{
  "page": 536,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5030,
      "text": "Then you, O misguided deniers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5031,
      "text": "will surely eat from the tree of zaqqūm[6],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5032,
      "text": "filling your bellies with it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5033,
      "text": "and drinking scalding water on top of it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5034,
      "text": "drinking like thirsty camels do.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5035,
      "text": "This will be their welcome on the Day of Judgment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5036,
      "text": "It is We Who created you; why do you not then believe [in resurrection]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5037,
      "text": "Have you thought about the semen that you emit?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5038,
      "text": "Is it you who create it, or is it We Who are the Creators?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5039,
      "text": "We have ordained death among you, and nothing can overcome us",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5040,
      "text": "from transforming you and recreating you in forms that you do not know[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5041,
      "text": "You are well aware of the first creation; why do you not then take heed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5042,
      "text": "Have you thought about what you sow?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5043,
      "text": "Is it you who cause it to grow, or is it We Who make it grow?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5044,
      "text": "If We willed, We could reduce your harvest to rubble, leaving you to wonder and lament,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5045,
      "text": "“We suffered loss,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5046,
      "text": "rather, we are deprived.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5047,
      "text": "Have you thought about the water that you drink?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5048,
      "text": "Is it you who bring it down from the clouds, or is it We Who bring it down?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5049,
      "text": "If We willed, We could make it salty; will you not then give thanks?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5050,
      "text": "Have you thought about the fire that you kindle?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5051,
      "text": "Is it you who produced its trees[8], or is it We Who produced it?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5052,
      "text": "We made it a reminder [of the Hellfire] and a benefit for the travelers[9].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5053,
      "text": "So glorify the Name of your Lord, the Most Great.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 470,
      "hizbQuarter": 214,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5054,
      "text": "I do swear[10] by the positions of the stars –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5055,
      "text": "and this is indeed a great oath, if only you knew –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 76,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 536,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
